# Live site only

- The only environment for QA, browser checks, smoke tests, and “does it work?” verification is **https://arabicbuzz-fooc9h.cranl.net/**
- **Never** use localhost, `127.0.0.1`, `next dev`, or local preview URLs for verification
- After code changes: commit → push to `main` → wait for CranL deploy → verify on the live URL
- Do not start local servers to “check the UI”
- Netlify (`arabicbuzz.netlify.app`) is retained as a fallback only while credits allow; do not treat it as primary QA after CranL cutover
